<title>USA: Waban sees Q4 fully diluted EPS about even.</title>
<headline>Waban sees Q4 fully diluted EPS about even.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waban Inc said on Tuesday that it expects fully diluted earnings per share for the fourth quarter to be even with last year's $0.71.</p>
<p>The company expects fully diluted earnings per share for the fiscal year to be five percent higher than the $2.05 recorded last year.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
